== multipliers, parts per thousand ==
advantage 1500  neutral 1000  disadvantage 667

== relations ==
neutral   beats -                    weak to -
water     beats fire, metal          weak to ground, electric
fire      beats grass, ice           weak to water, wind
grass     beats ground, wind         weak to fire, metal
ground    beats water, electric      weak to grass, ice
ice       beats ground, metal        weak to fire, electric
metal     beats grass, wind          weak to water, ice
wind      beats fire, electric       weak to grass, metal
electric  beats water, ice           weak to ground, wind
light     beats dark                 weak to dark
dark      beats light                weak to light

